WEBVTT

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:31.844
Sono i ricercatori del Flying Machine Arena research team.

00:15:31.844 --> 00:15:35.654
(Applausi)

00:15:35.654 --> 00:15:39.753
Federico Augugliaro, Dario Brescianini , Markus Hehn,

00:15:39.753 --> 00:15:41.671
